from-arsenal-to-the-ball-god:
Opening his eyes, Ma'el returns to 2010, embodying a young general about to be eliminated from Arsenal's youth academy. Luckily he's armed with a skill level panel.
Grind from [Level 1 Power] to the overwhelming [Level 5 Muscle Dominator];
Grind from [Level 1 Running] to the absolute crushing [Level 5 Speed Demon];
Grind from [Level 1 Long Shot] to the ruthlessly powerful [Level 5 Battle Axe Heavy Cannon]!
